records.rationale:
In `store.js.es6` `_hydrateEmbedded`, the new plural branch for keys matching `/(.+)_id(s?)$/` deletes the original `*_ids` field unconditionally:

```js
const hydrated = obj[k].map(id => self._lookupSubType(...));
obj[self.pluralize(subType)] = hydrated || [];
delete obj[k];
```

Unlike the singular `*_id` case (which only deletes when `hydrated` is truthy), this always removes the `*_ids` array
